Text: 5. Conclusion and Future Works In this paper, we propose a GPT-2 based uniformed frame- work for generating major types of Chinese classical po- ems, including SHI and CI. To this end, we at ﬁrst deﬁne a uniﬁed format for formulating all types of training sam- ples by integrating more detailed form information, then present a simple form-stressed weighting method in GPT- 2 to strengthen the control to the form of CI. Preliminary experiments validate the effectiveness of our method.

