Text: In fact, the research on the automatic generation of CI is just at the very beginning stage. In this paper, we propose a uniformed computational frame- work that tries to generate major types of Chinese classi- cal poems with two major forms of SHI, Jueju, and Lvshi, as well as 121 major forms (Cipai) of CI using a single model. Preliminary experimental results validate the ef- fectiveness of the proposed framework.

